69932520767488",text:"丰密回想被盗十几万u，至今我也不清楚为什么会被盗。\n1/资产放在钱包很久了，是一组钱包，同一chrome下小狐狸同一助记词下面拖了子地址，期间助记词私钥都保存的很好。\n2/多链资产，分别有ETH/USDC/OP/ARB，有挖矿LP，也有钟爱的lens，zksync上的资产未转移（应该当时类似debank这种查不到zksync的资产）。\n3/时间：盗窃之人分2次手工转移了资产，大额是在前一天的67点转移，小额是第二天凌晨早上8点转移，刚好我起床发现资产被盗。\n4/所有的账号全部是精品ID，钱被偷叻，印钞机也没了，相当于家没了。亏惨了"}}},reply_to_results:$R[216]={__typename:"TweetResults",id:"VHdlZXRSZXN1bHRzOjE2NjM3OTkyNzYwODA4ODU3NjA=",rest_id:"1663799276080885760"},reply_to_user_results:$R[217]={id:"VXNlclJlc3VsdHM6MTM3Mjg3Njg3MTk5MDI3MjAwMA==",rest_id:"1372876871990272000",result:$R[218]={__typename:"User",core:$R[219]={screen_name:"KuiGas"},id:"VXNlcjoxMzcyODc2ODcxOTkwMjcyMDAw",rest_id:"1372876871990272000"}},rest_id:"1663869932566876163",url_entities:$R[220]=[],views:$R[221]={count:"22824"}}}}}},$R[222]={entry_id:"conversationthread-1663869932566876163-tweet-1663878056795308037",item:$R[223]={__typename:"TimelineTimelineItem",client_event_info:$R[224]={component:"tweet",details:$R[225]={conversation_details:$R[226]={conversation_section:"HighQuality"},timelines_details:$R[227]={controller_data:"DAACDAAEDAABCgABAAAAAAAAAAEKAAIAAAAAAAAAAAoAAwAAAaDczYRCAAAAAA=="}},element:"tweet"},content:$R[228]={__isTimelineTimelineItemContent:"TimelineTweet",__typename:"TimelineTweet",display_type:"SelfThread",tweet_results:$R[229]={id:"VHdlZXRSZXN1bHRzOjE2NjM4NzgwNTY3OTUzMDgwMzc=",rest_id:"1663878056795308037",result:$R[230]={__isTweetResult:"Tweet",__typename:"Tweet",cashtag_attachments:$R[231]=[],core:$R[232]={user_results:$R[233]={id:"VXNlclJlc3VsdHM6MTM3Mjg3Njg3MTk5MDI3MjAwMA==",result:$R[234]={__typename:"User",avatar:$R[235]={image_url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1951510357769592890/oim_Z9Fl_normal.jpg"},core:$R[236]={name:"丰密",screen_name:"KuiGas"},id:"VXNlcjoxMzcyODc2ODcxOTkwMjcyMDAw",identity_profile_labels_highlighted_label:$R[237]={},privacy:$R[238]={protected:!1},profile_image_shape:"Circle",relationship_counts:$R[239]={followers:107778,following:1077},rest_id:"1372876871990272000",super_follow